{"pageProps":{"title":"14. フレックスボックス","metadata":{"id":"24ba501ef33780e683f3dec2d9cb8a44","title":"HTML,CSS","tag":["web","HTML","CSS"],"visibility":["発展班","基礎班"],"order":1003,"category":"技術ガイド","iconType":"external","iconUrl":"https://www.notion.so/icons/code_orange.svg","coverType":"external","coverUrl":"https://www.notion.so/images/page-cover/met_william_morris_1877_willow.jpg","last_edited_time":"2025-12-04T03:01:00.000Z","update":false,"curriculumId":"24ba501ef33780e683f3dec2d9cb8a44","tags":["web","HTML","CSS"]},"mdBlocks":[{"blockId":"24ba501ef3378101a897d24520a75dd5","type":"heading_2","parent":{"color":"default","is_toggleable":false,"parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"問題１","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef33781ddbf55e012f90f03a3","type":"paragraph","parent":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"以下のようなHTML要素を作ってください。","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef337811ea22ee7783ae9c866","type":"code","parent":{"caption":[],"language":"html","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"<h2>名言</h2>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"card1\">\n        <h4>巧詐は拙誠に如かず</h4>\n        <p>\n            巧みに偽り誤魔化すのは、拙くても誠意のある行為に及ばないという意味。\n            巧みに偽り誤魔化してもその場しのぎにしかならない。\n            たとえ今は拙くても誠実に仕事に取り組んでいくことが長い目で見ると良いということ。\n            なぜなら、今は拙くても様々な経験を積んでいけばいずれ立派に務めを果たせるから。\n        </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card2\">\n        <h4>知識の発展は意見の相違に依存する</h4>\n        <p>\n            お互いの意見が異なるとき自分の意見が１００％正しいと考えてしまうと知識は発展しないということ。\n            満点ではそれ以上の発展はない。\n            鍛治職人は刀を叩くことで、出来立ての鉄の隙間にある目に見えない不純物を取り除いてより強い刀を作る。\n            知識の発展も似たようなもの。\n            自分と異なる意見を自分の意見にぶつけることで自分の意見にある矛盾に気づき、\n            その矛盾を取り除いていってより良い意見に発展していく。\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</div>","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef3378132b264fdd20f0d59c8","type":"paragraph","parent":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"以下のように要素を横並びにしてください。","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef337817082bfc44210b377cd","type":"callout","parent":{"color":"gray_background","icon":{"type":"external","external":{"url":"https://www.notion.so/icons/photo-landscape_gray.svg"}},"parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"お手本画像","href":null}]},"children":[{"blockId":"24ba501ef337813ab84fd621acc1a90e","type":"image","parent":{"parent":[],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ryukoku-Horizon/notion2atlas/main/public/assets/24ba501ef33780e8af31de34146e0db5/24ba501ef337813ab84fd621acc1a90e.png","height":858,"width":2384,"type":"png"},"children":[]}]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef33781c38f64d55c05c0a6fe","type":"heading_2","parent":{"color":"default","is_toggleable":false,"parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"問題２","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":"24ba501ef337812aa38de9f08052cafc","type":"paragraph","parent":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"「問題１」のHTML要素で、card1,2クラスに","href":null},{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":true,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"flex-basis","href":null},{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"プロパティを設定して、以下のように最初の要素の横幅の割合を30%にし、次の要素の大きさの横幅を70%にしてください。","href":null}]},"children":[]},{"blockId":